{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60337","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90080","text":"FleetPrompt — The Open Agent Marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-60338","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90081","text":"Discover, publish, and install production-ready AI agents. Built on trust scores, versioned manifests, and one-click deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-60339","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90082","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-60340","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60342","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90083","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-90084","text":" — FleetPrompt technical specification"}]}],"id":"blk-60341","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60344","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90085","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/BUILD.md"},{"id":"spn-90086","text":" — Implementation build prompt (9 phases)"}]}],"id":"blk-60343","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60345","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90087","text":"Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-60346","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8 (LiveView for UI, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migrations 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-60347","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90088","text":"Build commands"}]},{"id":"blk-60348","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"mix deps.get\nmix compile --warnings-as-errors\nmix format --check-formatted\nmix test                          # requires running Supabase for DB tests\nmix test test/fleet_prompt/       # unit tests (no DB required for most)"},{"id":"blk-60349","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90089","text":"Key modules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-60351","spans":[{"id":"spn-90090","text":"Module"}]},{"id":"blk-60352","spans":[{"id":"spn-90091","text":"Purpose"}]}],"id":"blk-60350","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-60353","spans":[{"id":"spn-90092","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Registry"}]},{"id":"blk-60354","spans":[{"id":"spn-90093","text":"Agent + manifest CRUD, version immutability, status transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60355","spans":[{"id":"spn-90094","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-60356","spans":[{"id":"spn-90095","text":"4-signal weighted trust computation (test 30%, spec 25%, usage 25%, audit 20%)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60357","spans":[{"id":"spn-90096","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Worker"}]},{"id":"blk-60358","spans":[{"id":"spn-90097","text":"GenServer per agent — recomputes, caches in ETS, broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60359","spans":[{"id":"spn-90098","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Supervisor"}]},{"id":"blk-60360","spans":[{"id":"spn-90099","text":"DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60361","spans":[{"id":"spn-90100","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search"}]},{"id":"blk-60362","spans":[{"id":"spn-90101","text":"pg_trgm + ts_vector full-text search with filters"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60363","spans":[{"id":"spn-90102","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Forks"}]},{"id":"blk-60364","spans":[{"id":"spn-90103","text":"Fork-and-customize with provenance tracking"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60365","spans":[{"id":"spn-90104","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake"}]},{"id":"blk-60366","spans":[{"id":"spn-90105","text":"ConsolidationEvent processing from Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60367","spans":[{"id":"spn-90106","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.InstallEngine"}]},{"id":"blk-60368","spans":[{"id":"spn-90107","text":"Install flow with permission checks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60369","spans":[{"id":"spn-90108","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.AuditWriter"}]},{"id":"blk-60370","spans":[{"id":"spn-90109","text":"Append-only audit event recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60371","spans":[{"id":"spn-90110","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher"}]},{"id":"blk-60372","spans":[{"id":"spn-90111","text":"Oban worker for async webhook delivery"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60373","spans":[{"id":"spn-90112","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Cache"}]},{"id":"blk-60374","spans":[{"id":"spn-90113","text":"ETS GenServer with 4 named tables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60375","spans":[{"id":"spn-90114","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.MCP.Server"}]},{"id":"blk-60376","spans":[{"id":"spn-90115","text":"MCP JSON-RPC server (7 tools)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-60377","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90116","text":"Supabase schema"}]},{"id":"blk-60378","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90117","text":"Tables live in "},{"id":"spn-90118","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-90119","text":" schema (migrations 030-039 in "},{"id":"spn-90120","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/migrations/"},{"id":"spn-90121","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-60379","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90122","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.publishers"},{"id":"spn-90123","text":" — marketplace publisher profiles"}]}],"id":"blk-60380","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90124","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agents"},{"id":"spn-90125","text":" — agent listings with search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-60382","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90126","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agent_versions"},{"id":"spn-90127","text":" — semver-versioned releases with JSONB manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-60384","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60387","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90128","marks":["code